1
00:00:00,917 --> 00:00:02,297
(Sheldon:)My apologies.

2
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:06,880
(Sheldon:)I would've been here sooner but the bus
kept stopping for other people to get on it.

3
00:00:08,091 --> 00:00:09,381
(Amy:)I saved you a dumpling.

4
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:11,510
(Sheldon:)Oh. Your concern for me is touching.

5
00:00:11,677 --> 00:00:14,807
(Sheldon:)It will serve you well
when you take me to the dentist tomorrow.

6
00:00:15,390 --> 00:00:19,310
(Amy:)I'm sorry, Sheldon, I'm busy. I'm right
in the middle of my addiction study.

7
00:00:19,477 --> 00:00:24,067
(Amy:)I've got a lab full of alcoholic monkeys,
and tomorrow we switch them to O'Doul's.

8
00:00:24,982 --> 00:00:28,322
You're my girIfriend and
you're not going to cater to my every need?

9
00:00:28,486 --> 00:00:30,736
(Sheldon:)Oh, where'd the magic go?

10
00:00:32,198 --> 00:00:34,408
(Penny:)Sheldon, that's not
what girIfriends are for.

11
00:00:34,575 --> 00:00:37,915
AIthough, you don't use them
for what they're for, so what do I know?

12
00:00:44,836 --> 00:00:48,006
(Bernadette:)Howard doesn't make me
do his shopping, take him to the dentist...

13
00:00:48,172 --> 00:00:52,302
(Bernadette:)- ...or pick up his dry cleaning, right?
- Absolutely. But when Ma's hips give out...

14
00:00:52,468 --> 00:00:53,888
(Howard:)...you're up, kid.

15
00:00:55,096 --> 00:01:00,026
Well, if Amy's too busy, it gives the rest of
you an opportunity to make my life easier...

